      "blockers": "Re-rendered and validated 2026-10-01 on Ben's machine; un-held 2026-10-04 (ships in the next release, behaviour rows held until Q03 is answered). 6,107 sightings + 1,980 effort segments, cruise_key on all 67 labels (track votes; CC0501 from its effort; 9 off-ichthyo surveys from cruise_label_crosswalk.csv, Q14 proposed). 6,097 group_size obs: the 10 sightings with Best 0/blank keep their sample row and publish no obs (Q13). Effort status moved from measurement_qual to obs_attribute effort_status (2,667 ON / 3,088 OFF). Per-cruise UTC offsets from EDI knb-lter-cce.262.2. Open: behaviour codebook Q03 (numeric codes beside farallon's word labels in `behavior`), 2022+ effort Q07, licence Q01, funding attribution.",
